@@ -26,3 +26,20 @@ default.json 为随客户端分发的内置默认配置；历史上曾经 CDN 
 现版本无请求或 URL 构造链路，只依赖本目录内置文件，其他字段与既有消费者保持不变。
 
 详细规则见 [用户社群入口配置](../docs/ui/settings-community-link-config.md)。
+
+### Discovered model metadata
+
+Account/API observations are stored as optional `discoveredProviderModelRules` inside the existing
+personal model-rules envelope. Resolution order is built-in recommendations → latest observation
+for the exact provider/model → explicit personal correction. Refresh replaces the observation for
+an existing ID atomically; it preserves model membership/order, enablement and user corrections.
+Settings uses built-in plus observed metadata as the editable recommendation, never labels a new
+observation as a user-entered override. Deleting/renaming a model/provider carries this observation
+with the same identity. Remote provisioning carries the same optional rule array.
+
+Older exact personal values have no reliable origin marker. Preserve them as legacy corrections;
+do not guess which were edited by the user or silently migrate them away. An upstream refresh can
+update the observed layer without erasing those values. This additive contract does not establish
+capabilities for ID-only API catalogs or solve the inherited generic runtime fallback policy.
+
+An advertised default reasoning level is stored as `optionSpecs.reasoningLevel.defaultValue` and used only when it belongs to the current supported set. New model selection, Composer options and the Agent model catalog use the same public Provider resolver; an absent or unsupported default retains the existing last-supported-level fallback. Explicit Session choices and saved user defaults keep priority. An unknown-only subscription effort list fails refresh explicitly instead of inventing `off`; last successful configuration remains intact.
